{
  "slug": "monday-crm",
  "name": "Monday Crm",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Run your monday CRM in plain language. Build a pipeline from scratch, start the day with a ranked deal briefing, spin up a forecast dashboard, audit board health, clean up messy data in bulk, and turn meeting notes into deal updates. Every skill writes back into monday as a real update, doc, or dashboard. Built on the official monday MCP connector.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **9 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (9): `activity-insights` (Analyze CRM activity data — rep performance, call and email volume, team activity breakdowns, and engagement stats), `automate-crm` (Set up, view, and manage automations on monday CRM boards using natural language — no block IDs or…), `daily-briefing` (Start your day with a prioritized CRM briefing — works for any monday CRM setup: pipeline, contacts, accounts,…), `data-cleanup` (Check your CRM board's health and clean up messy data — run a scored health check (missing fields,…), `forecast` (Build a forecast dashboard in monday — committed, best-case, and pipeline views by close month, rendered as real…), `log-activity` (Log calls, meetings, notes, and other activities to CRM item timelines — structured records with attendees, outcomes, and…), `meeting-to-deal` (Turn meeting transcripts into deal updates — key points, commitments, and next steps posted to matching CRM deals…), `run-sequence` (Manage CRM sequences end-to-end — list, create, enroll contacts, activate/deactivate, duplicate, and track performance), and 1 more\n- **MCP servers** (1): `monday`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install monday-crm@claude-plugins-official` from `mondaycom/mcp` (`plugins/monday-crm`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
